step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I spoke with the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> living in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>, and he told me he had even more <col=800000>Bones</col> he wanted collecting. I will yet again need to bring him the <col=800000>Bones</col> of various creatures. I should check the <col=800000>List</col> on the wall of his hut to see what he needs.</col>
step	2	-	After reading the list
line	<col=000080>I spoke with the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> living in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>, and he told me he had even more <col=800000>Bones</col> he wanted collecting. I will yet again need to bring him the <col=800000>Bones</col> of various creatures. However, I will first need to polish them. To do so, I need to get an <col=800000>Empty Pot</col>, fill it with <col=800000>Vinegar</col>, add the <col=800000>Bone</col>, and then boil it on a <col=800000>Range</col> or <col=800000>Fire</col>. <col=800000>Fortunato</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col> can sort me out with some <col=800000>Vinegar</col>.</col>
line	<col=000080>I still need to deliver <col=800000>Polished Bones</col> from the following creatures:</col>
