step	3	-	After collecting two bones
line	<col=000080>I spoke with the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> living in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>, and he told me he had even more <col=800000>Bones</col> he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the <col=800000>Bones</col>, but I quickly grew tired of doing so. I should return to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> to let him know that I've well and truly had enough.</col>
step	4	-	After dying
line	<str>I spoke with the Odd Old Man living in Silvarea, and he told me he had even more Bones he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the Bones, but I quickly grew tired of doing so.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> and let him know that I'd well and truly had enough of collecting <col=800000>Bones</col>. However, he didn't take kindly to this and seemingly killed me. I'll need to find a way to escape this situation I'm now in.</col>
step	5	-	After talking to Traiborn
line	<str>I spoke with the Odd Old Man living in Silvarea, and he told me he had even more Bones he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the Bones, but I quickly grew tired of doing so.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> and let him know that I'd well and truly had enough of collecting <col=800000>Bones</col>. However, he didn't take kindly to this and seemingly killed me. I found myself in some sort of infinite loop, with no clear way to escape it. However, I encountered <col=800000>Wizard Traiborn</col> who told me to meet him somewhere with some atmosphere.</col>
