line	<str>I spoke with the Odd Old Man living in Silvarea, and he told me he had even more Bones he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the Bones, but I quickly grew tired of doing so.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> and let him know that I'd well and truly had enough of collecting <col=800000>Bones</col>. However, he didn't take kindly to this and seemingly killed me. I found myself in some sort of infinite loop, with no clear way to escape it. However, I encountered <col=800000>Wizard Traiborn</col> who told me to kill <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col> and take his <col=800000>Staff</col>. If I do so, perhaps I can use it to escape.</col>
