line	<str>I spoke with the Odd Old Man living in Silvarea, and he told me he had even more Bones he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the Bones, but I quickly grew tired of doing so.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> and let him know that I'd well and truly had enough of collecting <col=800000>Bones</col>. However, he didn't take kindly to this and seemingly killed me. I found myself in some sort of infinite loop, with no clear way to escape it. During the loop I encountered <col=800000>King Roald</col>, <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col> and <col=800000>Tolna</col>, to name a few. Eventually, I came across <col=800000>Wizard Traiborn</col> who told me to kill <col=800000>Archmage Sedridor</col>. I did so and took his <col=800000>Staff</col>, which I was able to use to kill <col=800000>Tolna</col>. Perhaps I can now escape the loop.</col>
step	9	-	After taking a leap of faith
line	<str>I spoke with the Odd Old Man living in Silvarea, and he told me he had even more Bones he wanted collecting. At his request, I started collecting the Bones, but I quickly grew tired of doing so.</str>
line	<str>I returned to the Odd Old Man and let him know that I'd well and truly had enough of collecting Bones. However, he didn't take kindly to this and seemingly killed me. I found myself in some sort of infinite loop, with no clear way to escape it. During the loop I encountered King Roald, Archmage Sedridor and Tolna, to name a few. Eventually, I came across Wizard Traiborn who told me to kill Archmage Sedridor. I did so and took his Staff, which I was able to use to kill Tolna.</str>
line	<col=000080>After killing <col=800000>Tolna</col>, I escaped the loop and found myself in some sort of <col=800000>Ancient Dungeon</col>. I should look around and see what I can find.</col>
