line	<col=000080>After killing <col=800000>Tolna</col>, I escaped the loop and found myself in some sort of <col=800000>Ancient Dungeon</col>. I started looking around and encountered a <col=800000>Horrifying Creature</col>. However, it didn't seem to pose a threat. Instead, it told me that to escape, I'd need to find and destroy four <col=800000>Gatestones</col>.</col>
