done	<str>I continued exploring the Dungeon and found the Odd Old Man with a Skeletal Horror that he'd restored using the Bones I'd been gathering. It attacked me, but I was able to defeat it. I then found myself back in Silvarea. I confronted the Odd Old Man there, but he had no memory of what had happened, leaving me questioning the origin of the Skeletal Horror.</str>
